eattle Coffee Gear","items":[{"merchandiseItemRenderer":{"title":"Curtis TC3H Tea Dispenser, 3.5 Gallon, Stainless Steel, Lid, Welded Handles, Leak-Resistant Faucet, Front Drain, Compatible With G3 TCTS","description":"The Curtis TC3H 3.5-gallon stainless steel tea dispenser is a purpose-built solution for home brewers who demand café-quality service and serious coffee and tea enthusiasts running small events or pop-ups; its commercial-grade stainless construction resists dents, preserves flavor integrity, and cleans easily while welded ergonomic handles make transport safe and secure even when full. Engineered for technical precision, the sloped interior floor and front drain ensure near-complete extraction of every batch so you get consistent strength and minimal waste, and the leak-resistant stainless faucet shaft delivers smooth, controlled pours without dripping or fiddly maintenance. Designed to pair seamlessly with the Curtis G3 TCTS tea brewer (and compatible with select other models), the TC3H supports both hot and iced service, simplifies batch brewing and holding, and speeds service during busy periods without compromising flavor clarity. Easy to operate and built to last, it balances professional-grade reliability with homeowner usability—ideal for anyone who values accurate brewing, tidy beverage service, and a durable dispenser that performs day after day.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcT2Agcy6VjbdX8Rarm-x85OtRJqmJ4Nnm9P4Oy1kCpAyGAvQKZeCAzeZX1gy55ph75iUpfZZaw","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQwS8rtvNqiox-_lTArl9I2lx0cw58-XbEJ7GQMe3_B6WhCNU1jeBX7-j9773RKP-mirBKHeuo","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSMCRHPeZbSKUjoVvFIzpFmOXGqU7r1MlNQ46RBiSxGlyj86_ODBaAhGfd8vdE5bUhlG3D8Se0","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏2,354.43","vendorName":"Seattle Coff