hile offering a lightweight, durable build and a sleek glass handle for comfortable, precise pouring. Engineered by a chemist in 1941 and still respected for scientific precision, this brewer extracts bright, clean cups with exceptional clarity—its capacity handles brunches or multiple servings while the proprietary Chemex Bonded Filters remove bitterness and sediment so delicate oils and aromatics can shine. Whether you’re refining daily ritual pours or dialing in single-origin nuance, the wide opening and intuitive pour geometry make pour-rate control and bloom management straightforward, and cleanup is simple—rinse by hand or use the top rack of the dishwasher. Ideal for the thoughtful home brewer who values design as much as flavor and the serious enthusiast seeking consistent, repeatable extraction, the Chemex offers an elegant, reliable platform to highlight your favorite beans without unnecessary complication.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTQY9Tq876zrywBAqViekAoZixO6854zEc2TinRBbv31w11YldpMlg6VHK_2ES-WsEb43QyufwV","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTcUGZ0SPMlIF8jS3xGiiK_qaL0QuXyWpgcbCH30oGb_5lMB-SEYrB7sQ46Tus5T6xE6kn9pqtp","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTghkB8_JJHjF2msgiX9O5jIH6Iaiv2T001cA7kb2p0Qoo3G6itW0aHAXNYbv132MW9lAxU5YaS","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏473.03","vendorName":"Seattle Coffee Gear","trackingParams":"CI4CEJP0ARgDIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-E","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CI4CEJP0ARgDIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CI4CEJP0ARgDIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpINtdCCTVoTcIWeCPk9xrVT-dPV