ناطق الشحن محدودة ، من Seattle Coffee Gear","buttonAccessibilityText":"شراء سِلع من Seattle Coffee Gear","fromVendorText":"مِن Seattle Coffee Gear","additionalFeesText":"","showOpenInNewIcon":true,"priceReplacementText":"مناطق الشحن محدودة"}},{"merchandiseItemRenderer":{"title":"Rancilio Silvia Semi-Automatic Espresso Machine, Stainless Steel, 9.5 Inches","description":"Inspired by Rancilio’s commercial heritage, the Silvia in stainless steel is a no-nonsense espresso machine that blends rock-solid build quality with the day-to-day usability and technical precision serious home baristas crave. Its heavy-duty stainless casing and full-size 58mm portafilter give a real café feel and stable temperature mass for more consistent extractions, while the three-way solenoid valve relieves pressure after each shot so puck quality and shot cleanup mirror professional workflow. The commercial-style steam wand delivers powerful, controllable steam for dense microfoam and silky milk texture, and the chunky, intuitive controls make dialing in routine shots straightforward for everyday users while still offering the manual control more experienced enthusiasts want to refine dose, grind and tamp technique. Whether you’re upgrading from an entry-level machine or building a compact home bar, Silvia’s durable construction, predictable brewing performance and straightforward ergonomics reward practice without obscuring the fundamentals of espresso. It’s ideal for coffee lovers who value precision and longevity: a machine that performs like a café workhorse but sits comfortably on a home counter, rewarding both daily morning routines and focused tuning sessions.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRQpjI9j-giACa0XbJ-brKTRKGMXdBXQ7D2XuYPHCTZ3-q3ujpQKY8qI6ZxgeyWoyKHGAXJOiZt","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRAoYooAAm_K31y7SlXQOMJNS3TjVzgeP1vHQogrN6IFAGlZHkrbBP5lSsojOsu9p8wk3QdIAU