placementText":"مناطق الشحن محدودة"}},{"merchandiseItemRenderer":{"title":"DeLonghi Espresso Machine Semi-Automatic EC9885M, Stainless Steel Aluminum, Built In Grinder, Smart Tamper, Cold Brew Option, Auto And Manual, Dual ","description":"Built from brushed stainless steel and precision-milled aluminum, the DeLonghi La Specialista Maestro EC9885M is a semi-automatic espresso machine that blends robust build quality with thoughtful barista-level features for both everyday home brewers and serious enthusiasts. Its integrated conical burr grinder and Smart Tamping Station ensure consistent dosing and pressure, while sensor grinding and dynamic pre-infusion dial in extraction for balanced, repeatable shots; choose fully automatic brewing or switch to manual controls when you want hands-on refinement. Dual milk options—an automatic LatteCrema System and a manual steam wand—deliver textural control for silky lattes, cappuccinos, and microfoam for latte art, and a programmable hot water function makes Americanos or tea effortless. Uniquely versatile, the Maestro also offers a cold brew-style selector for iced coffees and a simple brew selector for espresso or lungo, so you can adapt drinks by season or mood. Everyday use is streamlined by a removable milk carafe, fold-out drip tray, and straightforward controls for fast cleanup and maintenance. If you care about precision, consistency, and durable construction—but still want an intuitive machine that grows with your skills—this DeLonghi offers the balance of technical excellence and user-friendly design.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSnaIeYZK6x5MM1pMtwZghsmXogB83mjegSAHnq1d6LhrdA5oY8bvXQmPlEgTmeCnUVgmmDx-0","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTAqPGsMloTURJBKKDC4-gwfu5YyYI9FagJ1djmdO2e9M0-koAoW7_Jh99QGBcZFrXUEQ5SzY8","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcR5e