day ease. Ideal for serious enthusiasts who value reproducible results and home baristas who want a no-nonsense, high-performing machine, the OXO 12-Cup balances precision, capacity, and usability to elevate morning routines and weekend entertaining alike.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQOpcawDlnCPy_7LH5928MynMINBCf3K_E_PzsvD8CoXPzSt8d3U4sPR0lr-tKhBBnF8c-fApQ","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQ9XXbAqiC9WApK8Ruz-HVTjcl6-7g3tz7EiRywh5fBdY_Zi1cM_OK2yEpQKzjNXV3IhMMoqpo","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRWWwEtiIRcCAgohH6yRngGiCHahCfFUgevn5jy2K3u_aUPU_PoLyTqBQaC64kKZYHz41MgciM","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏3,257.02","vendorName":"Seattle Coffee Gear","trackingParams":"CIkCEJP0ARgIIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-E","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CIkCEJP0ARgIIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CIkCEJP0ARgIIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpJY7WkO9SP_GpD1u1eVhMp2u6aQJZt1-8Y49I_7ZJi_VsM4CJ3A628DgZtpuFLpigExhBfzhutriz-kW5nl59j-i5R9Cmmq1cnaMH0lb1f13umN1I0R7VgSO8VF2ylL__0-4KVRi-8nZe5r3QRcRnVRpSkmudEmi5erpJZNKYUifgTPdnHAdKbGXzkzVGvcVQm7JmeD_JvmUCH4iPOFCQr2E7CA6EWGKrTy52bxJ9oucHF6AwAl3DPKv-XkspGkyz9U0DHSR0rLv7p9P4zUbjyokfy-N6xilsekgBwmb7xak9CIMplNRdpzkuEQtE0---tnuMAMpcEprgihca2xubKmvYv37CcINnRhTdgsJJZAFvQEgoMgKclf2ZFeCnBVlvOqTvyrPvcYiIkpfqWzRBFNuUCuGQiYuKA_YqnFn-S5lwb-9-N-y8DLhX1tYw-yOaK7EfOUOxnpstfrmLzWn-oCjgq49d69_HuIcFn79lAAYye_8TZ4-MpXznVu4hSz_bhtQKp26rBwaK_3iZ4gV3WIfpPuE6KK1cgBJ40OJiSUN2IZ2luBWXRiRboISU7rL6ApnoNc5lRyQWLpxlC4C_-3BMJELQRm45EwEnt6oo0ZgOMB9w96e3QsL8P9aV_QyKX62_xQpMYfUEJ5uDPf98X_bIkMfBg-2VWBBITspEAHuIwEEmAHRGmDbLYTlZh