action in most drip machines, delivering clean clarity, reliable crema reception in hybrid systems, and repeatable results cup after cup. Packaged in a 12 oz bag designed to preserve aroma and freshness, this blend removes the guesswork—no grinder tuning required—so you can focus on brew variables like dose, water temperature, and brew time to dial in your preferred strength. Built on Lavazza’s 120+ years of roasting expertise, the blend reflects meticulous sourcing and quality control that appeals equally to the everyday home brewer seeking convenience and to the serious enthusiast who values technical precision and consistency. Easy to use, versatile across household drip makers and office brewers, and thoughtfully balanced for both black-drinkers and milk-based drinks, Lavazza Classico offers a dependable, nuanced cup that rewards attention while making great coffee accessible every morning.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSGGi01D71TECQ-sbsi9Y57XaD0aXax2MiK0k9YV25JMl6hw42DgEGTJfNjxfHyYK6rfRFzziK4","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQtt-Kw9VnXdML83ZjS0Fi_v4IYRsQfsXhvVkO3hlSkLbk2I69O-kCqXA9gK5TK8w_okQeWqq-h","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQgiqRnYn2L9BWlltzz2TJ_jdStFH9lEvZGroEVwE4mRO_amLqdv7qjElUuAvPiIobBXk9Zox36","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏92.97","vendorName":"Seattle Coffee Gear","trackingParams":"CIgCEJP0ARgJIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-E","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CIgCEJP0ARgJIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CIgCEJP0ARgJIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpIHG_pSS6LPK8S-9-NuuBgzVOELgJGKMj1gZVRN6LClrJ22m_-h