 مناطق الشحن محدودة ، من Seattle Coffee Gear","buttonAccessibilityText":"شراء سِلع من Seattle Coffee Gear","fromVendorText":"مِن Seattle Coffee Gear","additionalFeesText":"","showOpenInNewIcon":true,"priceReplacementText":"مناطق الشحن محدودة"}},{"merchandiseItemRenderer":{"title":"Curtis Tea Brewer, 3 Gallon Stainless Steel, G3 Digital Technology, Precision Brewing Controls, Dual Valves, Fast Brew, Cold Water Lockout, 9.125 ","description":"The Curtis Low Profile Tea Brewer — 3 Gallon, Stainless Steel with G3 Digital Technology brings café-level build quality and technical precision to the countertop, combining a robust stainless-steel chassis and a compact low-profile footprint with commercial-grade components built for daily use. Its G3 digital controls give precise command over temperature, brew time, and volume so you can dial extraction to suit delicate greens, bold blacks, or concentrated blends, while the efficient dual-valve system separates concentrate and dilution cycles for consistent flavor every batch. Practical features like fast-brew mode for quick service, cold-water lock-out for reliable heat-up and taste protection, and the included TCO308 3-gallon dispenser for extended service and easy cleaning make brewing both simple and repeatable. Intuitive front-panel controls and clearly labeled settings keep operation approachable for everyday home brewers, yet the level of control and durability satisfy serious enthusiasts who demand reproducible results and long-term reliability. Ideal for homes that entertain, small offices, or dedicated tea lovers who want precise, fuss-free brewing without sacrificing construction quality or flavor fidelity.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTCVTQI7t-7yC5We1AbWJarArl9C7WL265nf-pdL0y41jVF4ZINOPUoqSjnkvGEcIgx0mQbto8p","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSJM6Yve2CoyUtzpz0j_-Mbytr7ERrHAazEQjFKvKTYjhvisEapPORCn4y