ltration reduce noise and descaling interruptions so you get reliable, repeatable shots without constant maintenance. Whether you want a single-touch espresso, macchiato, flat white, or iced latte, the 5500 combines thoughtful engineering and straightforward usability to bring precise temperature, grind, and milk performance to your countertop — perfect for households that value convenience and coffee lovers who enjoy fine-tuning their cup.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRHrVqX3AcEeiex8mzPuRTZRDPme3AlkTts8mB6zpxWX6-E9jT_ArRiq7CLjSu9vt4gUD2wt7-0","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQ-jGRlTYm7iJOFZiHj7IYC7bsLQfuEqJ8xY68_ftqHLY_TAOeXoK4wIVpha8nxKmQ_0LOPJKhE","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRvfU-qAPVESUxfgq3vZCHAtdi-MOe1Jpw15wdv6q6On2HrfTl9KbWb2qXTR0jlMzQdageF6VHb","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏12,097.74","vendorName":"Seattle Coffee Gear","trackingParams":"CIYCEJP0ARgLIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-E","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CIYCEJP0ARgLIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CIYCEJP0ARgLIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpLjmys-bcyJuKWagHW3SeFlfdBUgIzc_HOqMT9dVNqRG2Lfu7DLSoVM3bfNMWFBw4Uqvl1IbqNwEiO-rzCsPdZfYHVHeAFRVKCaPNzqERBuBJULQDvnrck3iapcP3ecZEEyHd8vRz2c5kD40X3QC_i9MmqR9h-w9yWNW_sLSU8ai6LeQx3o7a1DrAIynLnWX-1Cq5d3j_6i_TcXhmVPdMl3EkP28IY486NxicnPCEXdB41pW3MF_8T1Ar0XD7Dp9GSJAJesG9aMcRusklMFUcQwtY1VNrIJBMuzI3tJKsntiNDwLGOc5bTBBqi_Y3VEHw358hv_RKoqmcudAZnUxFAat9HOc5xLL1bHPlkRdzBunlJ0jxXaYVOUn-YE3ptBEkwJOcjLRx3o-P5pUw4V2lO_Cjplfw2JJrU571fCiOaAHR3dNgram7pWcx96TpXsP679kJnjD-12DtARoyvCthED2cLLW2_-wV4iyz8gsW-skDagvpsAvxYvklP40nY