Glass in Smokey Grey is a 3 oz precision espresso glass that marries deliberate engineering with everyday usability: its sloped inner curve and seamless profile guide an even, silky pour to highlight crema, aroma and the nuanced flavors of single-origin shots or balanced blends, while the thick, insulated glass construction keeps espresso at the ideal temperature without making the exterior uncomfortably hot to hold. Built to withstand regular use, the durable Smokey Grey glass reads as modern and restrained on your counter or in a tasting flight, and its 90 mL capacity is perfectly suited to single or double shots and integrates neatly with larger Vero pieces for milk-based drinks. Technical precision shows in every detail—consistent thermal performance, a weighty yet comfortable rim, and a shape designed to preserve texture—while ease of use comes through in dishwasher-safe care and a form that feels intuitive in the hand. Whether you dial in shots on a compact machine every morning or host focused tastings with friends, this demitasse offers refined control over the sensory experience without fuss, appealing to everyday brewers and serious coffee enthusiasts who value honest build quality and predictable brewing results.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSvVwS62vwchGVHUYQXAIL8d9DO0SWz9bwBfBYlZd_zVBbEhzMzVpBQspO5DpcjJjR-pKhlcIxxqdw","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQUcA3FCvb5j_PuA8aiF3UnkOqqSx9BrtDVEXCxMy_S8Vuhe1xKt5k6jcyfhLfOUEuc4cg486xm-5Q","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQtec_5o2mAozNxlewwVB4jEUNS-BDQ2XyXH59GetU97CaApIGBzIO3MAOxC4Vs12n-RcVhNX6uQg","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏130.29","vendorName":"Seattle Coffee Gear","trackingParams":"CIUCEJP0ARgMIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-E","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CIUCEJP0AR