uct_shelf\u0026utm_source=youtube","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW"}}]}},"accessibilityTitle":"notNeutral Vero Demitasse Espresso Glass, 3 oz, Smokey Grey, Thick Insulated Glass، مناطق الشحن محدودة ، من Seattle Coffee Gear","buttonAccessibilityText":"شراء سِلع من Seattle Coffee Gear","fromVendorText":"مِن Seattle Coffee Gear","additionalFeesText":"","showOpenInNewIcon":true,"priceReplacementText":"مناطق الشحن محدودة"}},{"merchandiseItemRenderer":{"title":"Lavazza Decaf Espresso Ground Coffee, 8.8 Oz, Pre Ground, Swiss Water Process, Nitrogen Flushed, Ideal For Espresso Or Drip Brew","description":"Lavazza Dek Decaf Espresso Ground Coffee — 8.8 oz nitrogen-flushed brick — delivers café-quality, decaffeinated espresso for home brewers who value craftsmanship, consistency, and flavorful results: decaffeinated using the Swiss Water Process to preserve aroma and body without chemicals, this expertly blended Arabica/Robusta mix offers a balanced, full-bodied profile with velvety notes of roasted cereal and dried fruit that suit both straight espresso and moka pot brewing. The fine, pre-ground grind is dialed for pressure-based extraction and stovetop moka convenience, making pull-to-pull shot consistency simple for everyday drinkers, while the precision of Lavazza’s roast profile rewards enthusiasts dialing in tamp, dose, and temperature. Packaged in a nitrogen-flushed, resealable 8.8 oz brick, the build quality of the packaging protects freshness and makes the coffee easy to store and use daily, with no guesswork — simply open, dose, tamp, and brew. Practical and refined, Dek is ideal for those who want authentic Italian-style espresso without caffeine, for late-night sippers, households that serve multiple drinkers, and dedicated hobbyists who appreciate reliable extraction and nuanced flavor in every cup; note the fine grind is not suited to French press or other coarse methods.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRB9