ouchscreen puts group controls, brew counters, and maintenance cues within a few intuitive taps, making training fast and daily operation straightforward without sacrificing technical precision. Steam power is robust and consistent for silky microfoam, and optional ergonomic details—soft-touch steam wands, LED work lights, automatic group flush—make long shifts or morning routines more comfortable and efficient. Ideal for passionate home brewers who want commercial reliability and for serious coffee professionals running a compact service, the Aurelia Wave focuses on repeatable extraction, thoughtful ergonomics, and durable construction so you can concentrate on dialing in espresso and milk texture rather than troubleshooting hardware.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQBImemQmUZWOWYN5Ntxy-V47gLOom7gbXupL_-rm-wWWaxV57HUsGvaK8QsdJcU6LvslGKvvw","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcS76HUjib_9qJ7Bk3YhdUpYKFidMYTkaSBYa8HayupsGXxPvtvGhu9gNtjQV5nYCuX9ApBndFE","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTwpFShpczs-dh5uC9eAh0X3M4VtWAo_iGTTY8D7baLnIPL45hq26GGIVMpJSaSn-AGe5iMgOA","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏124,235.40","vendorName":"Seattle Coffee Gear","trackingParams":"CIMCEJP0ARgOIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-E","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CIMCEJP0ARgOIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CIMCEJP0ARgOIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpLZiXgNtVvPU0MD6lqUXgbArIE3Jlsvss7dNkIjAKoyDCoucytMkBSnLVmQuW9IQU--SM0vcBCcdzTTwX4yO3msdufeIpLCgJhmeIDFRGC5Pk5ws555gAUpvQbhpJ6Bo_Pnr9XCQSQmOvDWwNXg1Ty5Ou2RDUylNHv1GBbREMv9mCv_BPiae-QBz9vpbFK6zjYmVIHV6cG0-UnU5_oG