مِن Seattle Coffee Gear","additionalFeesText":"","showOpenInNewIcon":true,"priceReplacementText":"مناطق الشحن محدودة"}},{"merchandiseItemRenderer":{"title":"Technivorm Moccamaster KBGV Select Brewer Coffee Maker in Juniper | Size: 40 oz | Seattle Coffee Gear","description":"Whether you brew for one or two, make the most of your morning cup with the Moccamaster Select Coffee maker. The newest iteration of the storied KBG brewer, the Select brings adjustable flow rate to a winning formula of excellent build quality and exacting temperature consistency. Select between half and full-pot options for a just-right volume of coffee. With a 40-ounce max capacity, gold-cup standard brew temps, automatic drip stop, and an impressive 5-year warranty, the Technivorm KBGV Select brings quality and flexibility in spades. | Technivorm Moccamaster KBGV Select Brewer Coffee Maker in Juniper | Size: 40 oz | Seattle Coffee Gear","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQiZ2lePE3j9nXqLvT3N2xZzThzZvbis5iLhJU8WqMn_RbqrmWHDgZgn4-GidwcizD05_muqmk2","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQ4pb5zPanqKrRadZ81o97POIQh3-4NfrguOF2ixPv8gnKwo5v8i3IHAYrM5G0IV5bNH7XIw7XO","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcT7pojngFfCsOkgub_fT0JqufIIjpk6kLPlVP7QJqNGCJ0z-wj4U1dQy34cJWjjA3fi5E3STZmX","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏3,433.93","vendorName":"Seattle Coffee Gear","trackingParams":"CIICEJP0ARgPIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-E","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CIICEJP0ARgPIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CIICEJP0ARgPIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpLbqK9u62MnsjwOfGzJ1SC8A3nTEQv4BjS