r","fromVendorText":"مِن Seattle Coffee Gear","additionalFeesText":"","showOpenInNewIcon":true,"priceReplacementText":"مناطق الشحن محدودة"}},{"merchandiseItemRenderer":{"title":"Zoka Coffee Decaf Espresso Paladino Coffee, 12 oz, Medium Roast, Whole Bean, Fruit-Forward, Brown Sugar Notes, Small-Batch Roasted, Coffee \u003e Shop ","description":"Zoka Coffee Decaf Espresso Paladino — 12 oz, medium-roast whole bean — delivers a small-batch, Seattle-roasted decaf that balances build-quality craftsmanship with reliable brewing performance, giving both everyday home brewers and serious coffee enthusiasts a nuanced, low-caffeine option. Carefully roasted in tight batches to preserve clarity and consistency, these beans open with fruit-forward acidity and warm brown sugar sweetness, producing a full-bodied espresso shot with clean crema or a layered pour-over cup with vivid clarity; they also perform smoothly in French press, AeroPress, and drip systems, rewarding attention to dose, grind, and extraction. The recipe focuses on technical precision—consistent roast profiles, tight bean selection, and packaging sealed for freshness—so dialing in grind size and brew time yields repeatable results whether you’re pulling daily espressos or experimenting with recipes. Decaf without compromise, Paladino is sourced responsibly from trusted partners and roasted to highlight origin character while minimizing bitterness, making it ideal for lovers of nuanced flavor who want evening indulgence or caffeine-sensitive drinkers who refuse to sacrifice complexity. Easy to work with yet sophisticated in profile, this is a versatile staple for anyone who takes their coffee seriously and expects reliable, delicious results every brew.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRGa6Z_qjewrAPh_yWITXeP8TGK0VLgdSeTozmwa9AQqsxyzAsNMeCT_QZvV9RLz8X7XcKj4FsE","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTnL865j