shest raw material possible so extraction is more predictable and expressive. The heavy-duty construction and thoughtful engineering—tight vacuum seal, sturdy materials, and a design that resists light and moisture—speak to long-term durability and technical precision, while the removable inner lid and dishwasher-safe components make daily use and maintenance straightforward. Whether you’re dialing in recipes on a precision espresso rig or brewing pour-overs and batch drip for morning routines, the Airscape Kilo keeps beans stable and flavorful between brews, making it a smart, understated upgrade for anyone who treats coffee as craft.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTJJF5Tt4jM2sLzR-SHhUNgrO2IfV6k6cF-pntCHDNCMjufUxwhynHMk3KB17az5zSAMW2U4zg","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTSftzKZkcIdge8HEPResJ0oyelW00mYZXmNNVk48KHATGQREv_kN8pDweYTp9OaXYYgYI9sIE","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQqImwKIJ_bJeoTB5EUpH-KWzGEaiNH7qm0rDwDyUdV1i1UXyJ8fSGZY_eLKQ7KvJLkz2uIS6w","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏456.00","vendorName":"Seattle Coffee Gear","trackingParams":"CP8BEJP0ARgSIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-E","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CP8BEJP0ARgSIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CP8BEJP0ARgSIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpLBmKGrZCSj2jhIfNqCQlhCw8E074u7YNVa-rwzHAKfMmjTdMDTxlMlc7mwTveJ7-FePByFJjCrJUOlVcVo6E-Gks5YJ6HN_cUHXxS8PGasmjUvHDTjSob421fQnf0k_LClnci6pq36hAN_rslZhlD2G6WtAbQCboJsV6WU7FCnyE10giQ-0S2kpGWUkn9M3Z_bgU7mswqzWpKxNJL2yqd2AMpHZvdLj4OJp7ufFOQ5GdIjeBHaIQLyHNEc3UpJLUnXCFTkW5Z1boBbs4NaiA6xBHWiTJ4mZiqCEB8sPyCdVL7PeH2FQaP901fyxc