Depth, Handleless Palm Design, Hand Turned Wood, ","description":"The Saint Anthony Industries Levy Precision Coffee Tamper in hand-turned maple marries refined craftsmanship with practical engineering to deliver reliable, repeatable tamping for both curious home brewers and serious coffee enthusiasts; its 58.3 mm stainless steel base is machined for a precise fit in most 58–58.5 mm portafilters, providing an even, level puck that improves extraction consistency, while the adjustable depth collar lets you lock in the exact tamp height for identical results shot after shot. Built to feel substantial yet balanced, the 1.25-pound stainless base and handleless palm design promote a natural, ergonomic tamping posture that reduces wrist strain and accelerates workflow without sacrificing control, and the smooth maple body is comfortable to hold, visually warm, and finished for easy cleaning. Technical precision and durability are evident in the solid materials and tight tolerances, making the Levy an ideal tool for anyone focused on dialing in technique and brewing better espresso at home or in a compact professional setting.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQp8y1EbST2oeDdtlv_2EYHivhnH0sgjWBMfagGpS-SWYV8ItwRjzZorUfDFbQtJApGOAsHaZ3OLeY","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRENXjiuJDs7Rb_Lhr4TZ8pv_WrIPAgzdpcw8toZ0RZpyJgvx9Sg6mscZHmNVlvkG1Ndv0lNyHtBrw","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQN_HC27V_EHT-ziGL2HowYKwR_oyEZBwwSBpResZns_Ssq_kqrKZK0tgYtsAysm8kkYF00ErW_dn4","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏1,572.72","vendorName":"Seattle Coffee Gear","trackingParams":"CP4BEJP0ARgTIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-E","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CP4BEJP0ARgTIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams