\u0026utm_source=youtube","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW"}}]}},"accessibilityTitle":"Saint Anthony Industries Levy Precision Coffee Tamper - 58.3 mm, Maple, Stainless Steel | Adjustable Depth, Handleless Palm Design, Hand Turned Wood, ، مناطق الشحن محدودة ، من Seattle Coffee Gear","buttonAccessibilityText":"شراء سِلع من Seattle Coffee Gear","fromVendorText":"مِن Seattle Coffee Gear","additionalFeesText":"","showOpenInNewIcon":true,"priceReplacementText":"مناطق الشحن محدودة"}},{"merchandiseItemRenderer":{"title":"Breville Force Gauge Tamper - 58mm, Stainless Steel, Walnut | Pressure Gauge Display, Leveling Collar, Spring Loaded Base, Accessories Tamper","description":"The Breville Force Gauge Tamper — 58mm in stainless steel with a walnut handle — brings café-level control and refined build quality to the home barista's toolkit, delivering repeatable, professional tamping without fuss. A clear force gauge displays tamp pressure in kilograms so you can learn and reliably reproduce the sweet spot for your grind and dose, while the spring-loaded design supplies tactile feedback and a consistent end point for fast, intuitive use. The 58mm base fits commercial-style baskets and the precision-machined stainless steel face plus integrated leveling collar promote even compression and reduced channeling for fuller body, more even extraction and richer crema. Ergonomic walnut construction and solid metal craftsmanship feel balanced in the hand and wipe clean easily, marrying durability with an attractive countertop presence. Whether you’re dialing in recipes, chasing microscopic improvements shot to shot, or simply want consistent espresso from your daily routine, this tamper supports both curious everyday brewers and serious enthusiasts who value technical precision, ease of use, and dependable results.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcT9gBq9uayB_6yxpz4vJKjhASk9CykWj47brlBxJmDNDhUaFPzDZdzFmwkYwfkkvzK-Lz1LVwc","width":128