d blend from Brazil and Asia. Full-bodied, long-lasting flavor for those who want to avoid caffeine without giving up delicious Italian coffee. Lavazza uses a modern process of decaffeination with carbon dioxide that does not diminish the flavor and aroma of the roasted coffee beans, a potential downfall of the Swiss water process. The use of carbon dioxide and pure water also avoids the use of potentially harmful substances in the decaffeination process.\u003c | Lavazza Dek Espresso Decaf Whole Bean 1.1 lb | Size: 1 pound | Seattle Coffee Gear","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSCLb6SVFJBHEO3i5lzKvvwd3Csr3SBv8ZS78jVucdgqp9etZoq9T9kgBrqy9oQeEnMf3yn4R_z","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcT97I4h0jBtCD0X9GkjoOl76BfutrQ9EAJ4Aej_g2mi6POLIMnXcO6bsPr1fOqxwHfnGRDldJ3E","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcT999zafBhRCr5O62gR_gIT1Eb6zBat6jLqS6MGunq7NFcs_cLKgpwhOaxKiFT3aRWegEs3NwJJ","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏174.87","vendorName":"Seattle Coffee Gear","trackingParams":"CPsBEJP0ARgWIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-E","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPsBEJP0ARgWIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CPsBEJP0ARgWIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpITrfQA_5PL_lxU3zK2vLFE_NqRwj_-gU7DvjgiJUzYGERKsj58_a8CMCxurcJ2KO9dh9OMReIKYamn285uhHpJl5RXKnYk3Xgm0ZwbeFlbQYtU5zdm10bIf7T_FBPQRgJysj0FbVUINE8wxdnojyyqKLx6FfATRGyvD7vJcz1ln38QBxqAJacorkeYZGFZ6kZ1R8z_041trflDzev1x7QUPnXLifBg9_Lqr55J0u2NbBacT2WgWaPLGmv6cYk8P947zmLsM8cLARiyoCbsRbaRr9taetqrWAKs2GlNluixUwnSitWEp3okOj3ELQkvHy8Qo9CNpfW6sVPgqb1ms0DrWUh8k5O6712gUx5DlWl5N8qbvCkv-II74pPYzM5vwDQcA5j5S64ZADyyeVpiQoQw