to FAST V in chrome brings professional build quality and refined everyday usability to the home countertop, with a stainless-steel chassis, three-dimensional side panels and an integrated cup rail that feel built to last and look at home in any kitchen. Under the hood a heat‐exchanger boiler and Rocket’s updated group head work with an easy-adjust PID to deliver faster heat-up times and tighter, more consistent shot temperatures—so both routine morning pulls and careful dose-and-tune sessions yield stable crema, balanced flavor and improved extraction control. Brewing capabilities extend from quick, dependable espressos to textured microfoam for milk drinks, aided by soft-touch controls, an integrated shot timer and an ergonomically placed steam wand that make dialing in drinks straightforward for daily use yet precise enough for enthusiasts chasing reproducibility. Optional eco mode and intuitive operation keep running the machine simple and efficient, while the refined ergonomics and serviceable internal layout speak to long-term ownership and straightforward maintenance. Ideal for home brewers who want café-grade performance without complexity, and for serious coffee lovers who appreciate technical accuracy and a machine that rewards experimentation.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQvRTkra79tE-KSLZgYp2JU1JmoHnwoIi2wIy2NybVvAXtcCtgXNFKCZMbrW-8eIjKTQy2wBT8","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSYdmmCK4xbqr478xP0d0n5K948LpRcCkbjd4DUCTFmtlpVIBYZ3VoA8Z6cDUVbN5zQKRmq2QA","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcR-bGSQUjG_nNbIwDSuQX2JOWz-M3amYDeXHq3D_VedKJA2Ep3jDbCqqGMtu_7iXsjso-0yYRA","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏25,591.57","vendorName":"Seattle Coffee Gear","trackingParams":"CPoBEJP0ARgXIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-E","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrac