ntain stable temperatures for precise, repeatable extractions while the 45-step electronically adjusting grinder, automatic dosing and tamping, and Air-Inject steam wand with built-in thermometer deliver cafe-level brewing and silky microfoam with minimal guesswork. Smart engineering meets thoughtful usability: Breville’s Auto Dial-In algorithmically tests dose, volume and time then automatically adjusts grind to keep you dialed in, while an easy swipe to manual mode gives experienced users full control over grind and shot settings. Daily life is considered too — front-fill water tank, pop-out transport wheel, scheduling, Breville+ app connectivity and programmed backflush/steam-clean cycles simplify maintenance so the machine stays at peak performance. Ideal for the everyday home brewer who wants reliable, high-quality coffee every morning and the serious coffee lover who wants the technical precision of a prosumer machine without constant tinkering.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSjkmpYlmYDo2gnlrzrFk240AVG-2CdACsYmVz3Iglw3ANnzdCyVaRl68vgB5yx5Yklam8EDS8","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcS1A2Z1bCMiZ6a1a0XjVpfhfr5WjOKN4th_-rR1yqAGHBw1s9a2ryH6bbtu7se8K2WY6n10gvM","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTVHM305aU0Vg-KO2QNEW5bpkVREjOU333eXT116gQhjBMKmXax_FjsYAX9pd2bbj-kBDifNYo","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏27,917.61","vendorName":"Seattle Coffee Gear","trackingParams":"CPgBEJP0ARgZIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-E","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPgBEJP0ARgZIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CPgBEJP0ARgZIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken