spresso Machines, Brushed ، مناطق الشحن محدودة ، من Seattle Coffee Gear","buttonAccessibilityText":"شراء سِلع من Seattle Coffee Gear","fromVendorText":"مِن Seattle Coffee Gear","additionalFeesText":"","showOpenInNewIcon":true,"priceReplacementText":"مناطق الشحن محدودة"}},{"merchandiseItemRenderer":{"title":"Breville Barista Touch Espresso Machine, Semi-Automatic, Built-In Grinder, Touchscreen Control, Thermocoil Fast Heat-Up, Stainless Steel Aluminum, ","description":"The Breville Barista Touch brings café-level performance to your countertop with a thoughtful blend of build quality, technical precision and everyday ease of use—finished in professional-grade stainless steel with durable aluminum components for a machine that looks and feels built to last. Its intuitive color touchscreen lets you swipe to select, customize and save up to eight drink profiles, so beginners and seasoned enthusiasts alike can consistently dial in espresso, milk-based drinks and specialty recipes without a steep learning curve. An integrated conical burr grinder doses fresh grounds precisely for optimal extraction, while the ThermoJet heating system delivers near-instant heat-up and stable brew temperature for repeatable shots. The automatic steam wand uses temperature sensing to create silky microfoam for lattes and cappuccinos, and manual controls remain available for hands-on tuning when you want to experiment with grind, dose and texture. Compact yet feature-rich, the Barista Touch is ideal for the home brewer who values fast, reliable performance and the serious coffee lover who wants the control and quality of a semi-automatic in a streamlined, user-friendly package.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTxP-QHypOFhI7XoDsEpGC5y4PKdIWu7oUaPApANJ_9mPkIQhQhqZ2HfsI_MNRRKz3RC51TmI59","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSsLjM77P5TNIDaCrZcVh95nZ-kAqmaKSMFioGZ8gEd4rdgDDCs7c0KOT0TmMT_