of serious coffee enthusiasts, Biocaf cleans quickly, rinses cleanly and integrates seamlessly into regular maintenance schedules, helping machines maintain pressure and temperature consistency and prolonging component life. If you care about precision, taste and responsible cleaning, this powder is a straightforward, professional-grade tool to keep your espresso gear operating at peak performance.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTx3ZKicXYtpQ6t6t3hvxoNwASkD4MqaSdCkea8HRTnvNsEYE3GutpQTmgFDrY0s_fwOk0T3gyM","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQ0pmRjaKcXUANDFoV2aFTM1CxOJe33NAJ1A6KXCCPQsmh1hVPaxbEms69f-LQbeCvKb9fKpigq","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQfQ2pDB3hwZgX0INOA1UVnvDqnLyh3gS100_rIojhVhFarq7qrXkymrk9ohlmdjzbacDV0IG7l","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏102.28","vendorName":"Seattle Coffee Gear","trackingParams":"CPYBEJP0ARgbIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-E","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPYBEJP0ARgbIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CPYBEJP0ARgbIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"sendPost":true,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/feedback"}},"feedbackEndpoint":{"feedbackToken":"AB9zfpJwQIWM0vo7OJa8chTxj01mu6oKzDsMAIFkjirn1Zj5aFMDz_7UZQ5Hivvyp8nEtfsi6wr69UAajU9i4H11eCe44XFg6Xabk6XPuDzsAF1GkQDcOBFgGv6AwQDCmAfehrnodcn9jY0WulWDddIxSoma4UGlLVZqkUUQ44L8lvIAQmkHBiJguLQUHVOcZA6hcEppTHlBWszvyBdn52t1m4kANosHIESsKzRs0L8nzuMJOmKLM6xwMfncutTqQXHT-5yBmZLtT4qWG3ViqF4H_qRpXjzoxYmw3pPNcTS-rwZsRhtKIWQeKFqTRuRaITwPwsyWKMB_kzm6RRTKUUQXNX4CtQALO5xO44T0XvatGrutAvwUCzXuGPS5EslZB9fsHFmJyVSj8bcBABl4SwT_x5Ioxz4Q3n28a1c2nBy-1i8oxMRDYkfjDljxc0jK0ozPViGQ_MbrGToc4c5RXvuZk8IRm_ft_dbxjzJTneOcsgnc07Y66Q8jnz1I0oQ_f_t8WsJK9bXSt4Fa5o8okuxffV-4kbzCf9Mku0VIHVfRxLkCC