se, café-level control to satisfy both everyday home brewers and serious coffee enthusiasts; its solid construction and clean aesthetic house advanced brewing capabilities that let you dial in temperature, brew time, bloom duration, and brew ratio with repeatable accuracy, record multiple custom recipes and schedule your favorite brew for any day of the week, and switch seamlessly between single-cup pours using the included #2 cone and full-pot volumes with the flat basket — it even supports cold brew extraction — so you can explore pour-over style technique at scale. Controls are intentionally intuitive, with a straightforward interface on the unit and an optional Fellow app for recipe management and finer adjustments, making technical precision accessible without a steep learning curve. The result is consistent, balanced coffee from a machine built for detail-oriented experimentation and simple daily use alike: ideal for someone who values excellent extraction and repeatability but wants a reliable, easy-to-operate brewer that elevates everyday coffee.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcS2b9jRqZDyVnbCKZIzWFfa3Gq6UNHOf5bkszblV5ZnOl48CH_95a2a0Y3vcfA05UZUIy5Hfmg","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcS4wiXr44oc4vze1Xt0StZXbP1EEej9Q5r_gecF-rM-dteuVO_JEzssdcmFDwhOAPl1W6fdtzs","width":256,"height":256},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcSgeCrE_C0A4OdAjhtjFR4wa3emVtPwt1IOpawTDgjgq_787JiE6cnk0ObBen12pT3nlqq0_uk","width":512,"height":512}],"placeholderColor":4294967295},"price":"د.م.‏ ‏3,721.95","vendorName":"Seattle Coffee Gear","trackingParams":"CPUBEJP0ARgcIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-E","buttonText":"تسوّق","buttonCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPUBEJP0ARgcIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CPUBEJP0ARgcIhMInMOaociJlgMVsmt6BR2qVB-EygEEDPS-XQ==","commandMetadata":{"we