Gear, Coffee Makers \u003e Drip Brewers، مناطق الشحن محدودة ، من Seattle Coffee Gear","buttonAccessibilityText":"شراء سِلع من Seattle Coffee Gear","fromVendorText":"مِن Seattle Coffee Gear","additionalFeesText":"","showOpenInNewIcon":true,"priceReplacementText":"مناطق الشحن محدودة"}},{"merchandiseItemRenderer":{"title":"Gimme! Coffee Stargazer Medium Roast Coffee, Fairtrade, Organic, 12 oz, Almond And Chocolate Notes, Sweet Raspberry Finish, Specialty Arabica Beans","description":"Gimme! Coffee Stargazer Medium Roast is a thoughtfully crafted, Fairtrade and organic specialty Arabica blend that delivers consistent, nuanced cups for both everyday home brewers and serious coffee enthusiasts; expertly roasted by Gimme! Coffee to a precise medium profile, Stargazer balances build quality from bean selection through roast development—clean, even roasting highlights ripe almond and velvety chocolate tones while preserving bright, sweet raspberry acidity and a lingering, refined finish. Designed to perform across drip machines, pour-over, French press, and espresso, Stargazer’s balanced body and clarity reward careful dialing but remain forgiving for simple morning routines, making it ideal for anyone who values reproducible results and flavorful complexity. The packaging and roast approach emphasize freshness and consistency so each 12 oz bag delivers predictable extraction and cup quality, whether you prefer a delicate filter brew or a fuller- bodied press. Ethically sourced, sustainably grown beans add a meaningful provenance to every cup, and the blend’s technical precision—consistent roast color, developed sugars, and retained aromatics—ensures a reliable, delicious experience that complements both ritual and experimentation without pretension.","thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRttM_40TDg__Pr34O-Q7pvi_H7xBOamqKnE1HIeL1Ttia-JINRiHrVX24fYXqjCHNK0wixRRw","width":128,"height":128},{"url":"https://encrypted-tbn1.gsta